1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,340
Good morning and welcome to the harbour tour.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:05,100
Our boat leaves the pier in five minutes.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:09,480
Please keep your tickets ready for the crew.

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:12,760
On the left you can see the old lighthouse.

5
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:17,020
It was built in 1871 and still works today.

6
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,300
Thank you, and enjoy the trip!
